**/[nN][oO][tT][eE][sS].[mM][dD]
**/[tT][oO][dD][oO].[mM][dD]

# Local scratch note. Outside the canonical policy — it may be committed — but it
# is never product content, so the deploy filter drops it by exact basename.
MEMORIES.md

